      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00bf64cc7e6778809d770313",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "三冠赛马娘齐聚一堂的壮观景象\n令人不禁屏息。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b0c0b8afb7a810485d2a9189a7b7b9fe1585d01cffba46fd6d011805e28ed8b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1137/storytimeline_501137104.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a7792b9a4597e79cf8ef465",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是我要集中精神、重新思考。\n鲁道夫象征和成田白仁都是\n先行跑法的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b50ccf91d3f8083221aabb23fa8022c6dce2984819aa76276a95e4f46e82177f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1137/storytimeline_501137104.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        17,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/17/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7c8c94ab1a54c19ff1d0f7d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而相对的\n千明代表和黄金巨匠则是以\n后追跑法闻名的赛马娘……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e5423c26b33c754d60054a7bde4210ef0faec0a7f73c9bbb418d0711c00f1d7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1137/storytimeline_501137104.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        18,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/18/text"
    },
    {
